  <extension url="http://hl7.org/fhir/5.0/StructureDefinition/extension-Requirements.description">
    <valueMarkdown value="The [VHL Receiver](ActorDefinition-VHLReceiver.html) SHALL be capable of receiving a Verified Health Link (VHL) from a [VHL Holder](ActorDefinition-VHLHolder.html) through a supported transport mechanism (e.g., QR code scan, direct URL, or digital message).&#xA;&#xA;Upon receipt, the Receiver SHALL:&#xA;* Parse the VHL&#xA;* Validate its digital signature against a trusted key published by a recognized Trust Anchor&#xA;* Prepare to retrieve the associated health documents&#xA;&#xA;Receipt of the VHL may occur through direct user interaction (e.g., scanning a QR code) or automated channels, depending on the implementation context."/>
  </extension>
